  "_comment": "Z-Image Turbo - IMG2IMG. Load an image, it is resized to ~1 megapixel, encoded to latent and re-sampled. denoise controls how much changes: 0.3 = light restyle, 0.6 = strong restyle, 1.0 = ignore the input. Describe the WANTED result in the prompt. Default input image is example.png (bundled ComfyUI sample); override with run_workflow.py --input-image image=<your file>."
